---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Emergency AC Repair | Wake Forest & Rolesville, NC" description="24/7 emergency AC repair in Wake Forest and Rolesville, NC. Fast response when your air conditioner fails.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Emergency AC Repair</h1>
      <p>24/7 emergency AC repair in Wake Forest and Rolesville, NC. Fast response when your air conditioner fails.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>When your AC stops working in the middle of a North Carolina heat wave, you need help now — not tomorrow. Our emergency AC repair team is available 24/7 for Wake Forest, Rolesville, and surrounding Wake County homes.</p>
      <h2>What We Offer</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Available around the clock — including nights, weekends, and holidays</li>
        <li>Average response under 60 minutes in the Wake Forest / Rolesville area</li>
        <li>Service vans stocked with common capacitors, contactors, thermostats, and freon</li>
        <li>No surprise after-hours fees — transparent pricing from the start</li>
        <li>Licensed technicians who diagnose accurately and repair on the first visit whenever possible</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Ready for Fast Service?</h2>
      <p>Call or text <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>(919) 555-0199</a> for same-day AC service in Wake Forest, Rolesville, and nearby communities. Upfront pricing and a written estimate before any work begins.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call (919) 555-0199</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>